---
title: QDesk / QUE routing and evidence lifecycle
version: 1
---
flowchart TD
  A[QDesk intake request] --> B[Deterministic envelope validation]
  B --> C{Ingress decision}
  C -->|ALLOW: eligible to request admission| D[QUE admission policy]
  C -->|HOLD| H[Quarantine + missing evidence]
  C -->|REJECT| R[Reject + immutable reason]
  C -->|ESCALATE| X[Human / security / finance review]
  H --> B
  X -->|approved resubmission| B
  D -->|not admitted| Q[QUE admission receipt: deferred / denied]
  D -->|admitted| P[Priority + tier + ranker version]
  P --> G[Dependency DAG evaluation]
  G -->|blocked| W[Typed wait reason + next wake]
  G -->|ready| E[Capability + health + quota + cooldown gates]
  E -->|ineligible| W
  E -->|eligible| S[Route selection]
  S --> L[Claim + lease]
  L --> O{Execution evidence?}
  O -->|No live run / heartbeat| U[Claimed, execution unverified]
  O -->|Live run + heartbeat| EX[Observed executing]
  EX --> PR[Progress + output receipts]
  PR --> V[Independent verification / DoE]
  V -->|Fail| SI[SIE intake + diagnosis]
  V -->|Pass| T[Owning authority terminal receipt]
  SI --> CAND[Candidate repair + exact-head tests]
  CAND --> IV[Independent verification]
  IV -->|Pass + promotion gate| PROM[Authorized promotion]
  IV -->|Fail / hold| SI
  PROM --> LEARN[Learning + regression watch]
  T --> LEARN
  W -->|condition cleared| G
  U -->|execution observed| EX
  W --> ESC[Threshold escalation, idempotent]
  ESC -->|operator decision| G
  subgraph Read model only
    QD[QDesk projection: source + timestamp + freshness + evidence level]
  end
  P -.-> QD
  W -.-> QD
  EX -.-> QD
  V -.-> QD
  T -.-> QD
  ESC -.-> QD
